WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.872
Freshness is part of the data contract.

00:00:02.872 --> 00:00:09.847
Users should know how often the snapshot is refreshed, when the last successful refresh occurred,

00:00:09.847 --> 00:00:12.512
and how much delay is acceptable.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:16.527
They should also know what happens when a refresh fails.

00:00:16.527 --> 00:00:24.407
A materialized view without a clear freshness policy can be technically correct but operationally confusing.
